  "description": "The solver who will destroy the huge empire!\n\n This world we live in is ruled by one huge empire.  \n All powers, including politics, media, and the legal world, work for their empire,  \n A world where the masses feel at ease in the domination of that power...\n\n The story of a \"good guy\" who was never good enough to destroy their own huge empire.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000051774), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/59444412), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9207417), [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=2b0h)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[S.Chinese](https://ac.qq.com/Comic/ComicInfo/id/652513), [Japanese](https://piccoma.com/web/product/119519)",
